	<section_number>8.1A-304</section_number>
	<catch_line>Obligation of good faith</catch_line>
	<text>
		Every contract or duty within the Uniform Commercial Code imposes an obligation of good faith in its performance and enforcement.
	</text>
	<history>1964, c. 219, § 8.1-203; 2003, c. 353.</history>
</law>
